ccasional waste. The best quantity is roughly 1.10–1.15 × forecast, which favours candidate 1.\n- **Product 1:** a missing unit costs 9 and a surplus unit up to 10, so the best quantity is about 1.0–1.05 × forecast. Candidates 0 and 1 are both close. Candidate 7 overstocks and candidate 5 understocks.\n- **Last order (day 24):** candidate 1 orders 60 units of product 1 against about 68 expected demand. Candidate 0's 68 is better and gains it about 13.\n- **Net:** candidate 1 gains about 50 on product 0 over the month, more than it loses at the end. Its edge over candidate 0 is small compared with random swings in demand.\n\n**Shared start:** all plans run short in the first days (initial stock of 26 and 34 units against higher early demand), so this doesn't separate them. Cash stays positive for candidate 1 when the large day-4 order is paid."}], "container": null, "stop_reason": null, "stop_sequence": null, "stop_details": null, "usage": {"input_tokens": 2, "cache_creation_input_tokens": 3881, "cache_read_input_tokens": 2304, "cache_creation": {"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens": 0, "ephemeral_1h_input_tokens": 3881}, "output_tokens": 8, "service_tier": "standard", "inference_geo": "global", "speed": "standard"}, "input_transformations": [], "diagnostics": null, "context_management": null}, "parent_tool_use_id": null, "timestamp": "2026-10-25T20:02:14.815Z", "request_id": "req_011CgPYuFGUWXtwNS81HyZui"}, {"type": "stream_event", "event": {"type": "content_block_stop", "index": 1}, "parent_tool_use_id": null}, {"type": "stream_event", "event": {"type": "content_block_start", "index": 2, "content_block": {"type": "tool_use", "id": "toolu_013xJntQDTuBhs1L6rfiDiuX", "name": "StructuredOutput", "input": {}, "caller": {"type": "direct"}}}, "parent_tool_use_id": null}, {"type": "assistant", "message": {"model": "claude-opus-5-5", "id": "msg_011CgPYuFXcLW1aSy6GF2bqd", "type": "message", "role": "assistant", "content": [{"type": "tool_use", "id": "toolu_013xJntQDTuBhs1L6rfiDiuX", 